=== Before fix (hardcoded false) ===
resolveAllowPrivateNetwork: false
=> SSRF guard blocks 127.0.0.1:18901 — request never sent

=== After fix (opt-in enabled) ===
resolveAllowPrivateNetwork: true
=> SSRF guard allows 127.0.0.1:18901

